WEBVTT

00:02.100 --> 00:03.830
You...

00:03.830 --> 00:05.460
Why?

00:11.140 --> 00:13.440
I will not let things remain this way.

00:13.440 --> 00:15.840
Lend me your strength, please!

00:15.840 --> 00:20.650
There's a guy who ran off into Zymot
that I've got to pay back.

00:21.320 --> 00:24.420
Come with me to Zymot!

00:24.420 --> 00:26.220
No, don't!

00:29.790 --> 00:37.530
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

00:37.530 --> 00:44.500
Tooku tooi basho e to

00:57.850 --> 01:04.060
Kaze ni fukare aruite yuku

01:04.060 --> 01:11.020
Umarekita imi o shiritakute

01:11.230 --> 01:17.540
Tatoeba ushinau toki ga kitemo

01:17.540 --> 01:24.670
Dakishimeru koto ima, erabou

01:27.120 --> 01:34.520
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

01:34.520 --> 01:40.500
Nakusenai mono ni mukatte

01:40.500 --> 01:48.140
Kagayaita yume dake o taguriyosenagara

01:48.140 --> 01:55.010
Tooku tooi basho e to

02:02.220 --> 02:06.520
Episode 10
The Lonely Princess

02:22.740 --> 02:24.530
Is this...

02:24.840 --> 02:26.470
...Zymot?

02:31.780 --> 02:34.480
Hey, what are the red pipes for?

02:35.120 --> 02:39.690
They draw the plentiful groundwater
up into the castle.

02:39.690 --> 02:41.020
You mean Zymot's castle?

02:41.020 --> 02:43.290
Princess Rebecca!

02:43.290 --> 02:45.090
Princess Rebecca...

02:46.160 --> 02:47.660
I'm glad to see you're all right.

02:47.660 --> 02:50.470
I'm sorry to have worried you, Phillip.

02:50.470 --> 02:52.370
And the rest of you as well.

02:52.370 --> 02:54.040
Who are you?!

02:54.040 --> 02:55.600
You may not lay a hand on him!

02:55.600 --> 02:58.710
He rescued me back in Templar.

02:58.710 --> 03:00.670
He saved my life!

03:01.310 --> 03:03.680
I wasn't trying to save you.

03:12.050 --> 03:14.820
Those are the remains of the castle we once had.

03:14.820 --> 03:18.690
It was destroyed in a fight with the
forces of the current regime.

03:18.690 --> 03:21.530
Our hideout lies underneath it.

03:23.600 --> 03:24.930
Princess Rebecca!

03:24.930 --> 03:26.600
I'm so glad you're okay!

03:26.600 --> 03:28.570
Princess!

03:29.270 --> 03:31.070
Princess Rebecca!

03:37.950 --> 03:40.920
No... This can't be, Zed!

03:41.380 --> 03:46.390
My word, this is quite the turn
of events, now, isn't it?

03:46.390 --> 03:50.350
Good grief, that boy certainly
keeps me entertained.

03:52.530 --> 03:55.900
Has anything changed since I've been absent?

03:55.900 --> 04:00.800
No, we have only awaited your return anxiously.

04:00.800 --> 04:04.540
Now that the princess has returned,
let us take action at once!

04:04.540 --> 04:05.540
Right!

04:05.540 --> 04:09.280
Now is the time to overthrow the current
regime and restore the kingdom!

04:09.280 --> 04:10.280
Yes!

04:10.280 --> 04:12.350
What is your command, Princess Rebecca?

04:12.350 --> 04:15.450
Wait, we must consider things calmly.

04:15.450 --> 04:18.450
The current regime has far superior numbers.

04:18.450 --> 04:21.420
If we make the wrong move, we will
play right into their hands.

04:21.420 --> 04:23.090
But, Princess Rebecca!

04:23.090 --> 04:25.230
Then, what should we do?

04:25.230 --> 04:27.730
I intend to ask for Zed's cooperation.

04:27.730 --> 04:29.700
Huh? Me?

04:30.500 --> 04:32.800
Does he have that kind of power?

04:32.800 --> 04:37.440
And is it wise to put any trust in
anyone from Templar?

04:37.440 --> 04:38.540
Don't worry.

04:38.540 --> 04:41.510
I don't have any intention of helping you out.

04:42.110 --> 04:43.910
Pardon me.

04:55.190 --> 04:58.590
So, Zed's gone off to Zymot for real.

04:58.590 --> 04:59.890
That's right.

04:59.890 --> 05:02.190
Jeez, it's all that girl's fault.

05:08.800 --> 05:11.770
That Zed is such a fool!

05:12.610 --> 05:15.240
Do you think Zed will be all right?

05:16.840 --> 05:18.640
Heck if I know!

05:26.520 --> 05:29.980
Say, is Zymot Castle far from here?

05:31.130 --> 05:36.060
Please tell me, what will it take
to get you to help us?

05:36.060 --> 05:41.500
If you will assist us, I shall grant you a
special position in my kingdom!

05:41.500 --> 05:42.500
So please...

05:42.500 --> 05:44.300
Not interested.

05:45.140 --> 05:49.640
For one thing, you've got plenty of
comrades to help you out.

05:49.640 --> 05:53.550
But there is no one who has the power you do.

05:53.550 --> 05:57.510
Your control of Amir Gaul is certain proof of that.

05:58.850 --> 06:00.660
Amir Gaul?

06:00.660 --> 06:05.350
Yes, that is the name of the spirit you have:
Amir Gaul.

06:06.030 --> 06:09.360
It is said that it possesses
extraordinary fighting capacity,

06:09.360 --> 06:12.630
though no one has actually seen it in action.

06:12.630 --> 06:15.100
That's how valuable a spirit it is!

06:19.270 --> 06:21.070
Amir Gaul?

06:21.680 --> 06:28.150
I know! Why don't we assist you in finding
the person you are after first?

06:28.150 --> 06:30.080
That's my problem.

06:30.080 --> 06:32.290
It's got nothing to do with you.

06:32.290 --> 06:33.920
Where are you going?!

06:33.920 --> 06:36.290
Castle Zymot, obviously.

06:37.960 --> 06:39.590
Elda!

06:40.090 --> 06:41.720
Stop.

06:43.100 --> 06:44.600
What's this?

06:44.600 --> 06:46.570
Using force now?

06:52.340 --> 06:54.570
Excuse me.

07:02.620 --> 07:04.240
Zed...

07:08.190 --> 07:09.990
Princess Rebecca!

07:11.330 --> 07:13.290
Please remember your place.

07:15.800 --> 07:19.490
We must have his power, no matter what!

07:20.700 --> 07:22.770
Very well...

07:22.770 --> 07:25.470
We will follow and keep an eye on him.

07:33.080 --> 07:34.150
We're counting on you.

07:34.150 --> 07:37.120
Bring back Dumas at all costs.

07:37.120 --> 07:39.120
Got it!

07:39.120 --> 07:41.520
That's what we're here for.

07:41.520 --> 07:43.120
And Zed too.

07:43.120 --> 07:46.290
Bring him back, even if you have to drag
him with a rope around his neck.

07:46.290 --> 07:49.420
Are you really that concerned about Zed?

07:50.100 --> 07:52.830
Yeah, I'm concerned all right.

07:53.870 --> 07:55.970
Master Zico!

07:55.970 --> 07:57.940
What's the matter, Roya?

07:57.940 --> 08:00.430
Please let me go along to Zymot too!

08:01.580 --> 08:03.040
Don't be ridiculous.

08:03.040 --> 08:04.150
Out of the question!

08:04.150 --> 08:06.050
Please, Master Robès!

08:06.050 --> 08:08.020
I said it's out of the question!

08:09.450 --> 08:14.250
Well, this is one favor I cannot grant,
even if it is the request of a lady.

08:15.460 --> 08:17.750
Besides, the look on Grandpa's face scares me.

08:47.320 --> 08:51.090
You remember the promise you made me, right?

08:51.090 --> 08:52.660
I'll see that you keep it.

08:52.660 --> 08:57.030
That's why I served as a Joker for Zymot.

08:57.030 --> 08:58.430
Yes, all right.

08:58.430 --> 09:00.800
I will be sure to keep my promise.

09:00.800 --> 09:02.770
Don't worry.

09:09.240 --> 09:10.950
Very soon...

09:10.950 --> 09:13.410
My fate will change very soon.

09:17.920 --> 09:19.550
Master Hugh!

09:20.250 --> 09:21.920
Well? Has she been found?

09:21.920 --> 09:23.360
I'm terribly sorry.

09:23.360 --> 09:26.330
We have put all our resources into
the search for Rebecca,

09:26.330 --> 09:29.560
but we don't have any sort of
lead on her at present.

09:29.560 --> 09:31.230
Locate her at all costs!

09:31.230 --> 09:32.860
Sir!

09:34.840 --> 09:37.800
You're fussing quite a bit over
that little girl, aren't you?

09:38.840 --> 09:40.880
Have you fallen for her?

09:40.880 --> 09:43.340
I don't have time for your jokes.

09:48.180 --> 09:52.090
But do we really need Princess Rebecca?

09:52.090 --> 09:53.790
What do you mean?!

09:53.790 --> 09:55.820
What I'm saying is that

09:55.820 --> 10:01.700
perhaps Princess Rebecca's presence is actually
be more a liability to us than anything.

10:01.700 --> 10:03.730
Yes, you have a point.

10:03.730 --> 10:06.530
Hugh, Elmeida, Glaudio...

10:06.530 --> 10:10.240
We only really need to take out those three.

10:10.240 --> 10:14.640
There's not really any need to remain loyal to a
kingdom that has already been obliterated.

10:14.640 --> 10:21.580
So, if we can do that on our own,
we could take over Zymot ourselves.

10:21.580 --> 10:23.580
Mind your tongues!

10:23.580 --> 10:26.420
Princess Rebecca is in essence
the emblem of our cause.

10:26.420 --> 10:29.220
There are also many who follow us
because the princess is with us.

10:29.790 --> 10:31.630
Heh, you think so?

10:31.630 --> 10:35.060
Everyone's just pulled along by
their own selfish wants!

10:45.270 --> 10:47.780
Well, we are counting on you, Robès.

10:47.780 --> 10:50.650
Yes, yes. I understand.

10:50.650 --> 10:52.610
Well, shall we be going then?

11:23.610 --> 11:25.280
Spare us!

11:25.280 --> 11:27.950
I beg you! Just spare our lives!

11:27.950 --> 11:30.690
You're all useless!

11:30.690 --> 11:32.650
You're no better than trash.

11:37.760 --> 11:41.130
Those bastards, how could they?

11:55.580 --> 11:59.680
Master Hugh, we have detected a large
shifting shard energy output.

11:59.680 --> 12:01.920
We believe it most likely originated in Templar.

12:01.920 --> 12:03.080
Templar?

12:03.080 --> 12:04.250
How about that?

12:04.250 --> 12:07.050
So, is this, like, a retaliatory attack?

12:07.050 --> 12:09.020
That makes things more interesting!

12:18.870 --> 12:21.700
Master Robès, I am sorry.

12:21.700 --> 12:23.700
Good grief...

12:23.700 --> 12:27.140
Well, I'm stuck now that you've
decided to tag along.

12:27.140 --> 12:30.580
Just see that you look out for yourself.

12:31.210 --> 12:34.120
Everyone will be fully preoccupied with
watching their own backs.

12:34.120 --> 12:37.280
That should show you how
dangerous a place this is.

12:37.950 --> 12:39.920
Let's hurry and move out, Robès.

12:50.530 --> 12:53.590
I guess you've strolled on in here looking
for Dumas or something.

12:55.240 --> 12:57.170
What a bunch of fools.

12:57.170 --> 12:58.940
The enemy!

12:58.940 --> 13:00.570
Tovia!

13:02.040 --> 13:04.510
C'mon, let's do it!

13:16.590 --> 13:18.390
My spirit!

13:21.760 --> 13:23.390
Mr. Gordon!

13:36.110 --> 13:38.550
I'd like to see what's under that mask.

13:38.550 --> 13:40.510
You're a cheeky one.

13:48.020 --> 13:50.680
Looks like Templar has capable shard users too.

13:52.130 --> 13:53.230
Roya!

13:53.230 --> 13:55.020
Are you okay?

14:07.940 --> 14:09.440
This sucks!

14:09.440 --> 14:12.570
Is this the best Templar has for shard casters?

14:15.080 --> 14:16.710
Belladonna!

14:40.170 --> 14:42.640
Where am I?

14:43.310 --> 14:45.450
Get walking.

14:45.450 --> 14:47.910
Go on, move it!

15:10.970 --> 15:12.940
What is this place?

15:22.950 --> 15:24.620
Daddy...

15:24.620 --> 15:28.560
Win this fight if you want to leave here alive,
and for your family's sake too.

15:28.560 --> 15:30.180
Do it!

15:46.210 --> 15:48.000
Drop it!

15:50.340 --> 15:52.640
Dear!

15:56.250 --> 15:58.720
What's the matter? The kid's next!

16:14.800 --> 16:16.600
Well done.

16:17.910 --> 16:19.240
It's awful...

16:19.240 --> 16:21.010
What the heck kind of place is this?

16:21.010 --> 16:23.100
An underworld training ground.

16:24.240 --> 16:26.910
The only way out is to keep on winning.

16:26.910 --> 16:31.480
The only way to live is to keep on winning,
and then serve as a Zymotan soldier.

16:32.290 --> 16:34.460
Zymotan soldier?

16:34.460 --> 16:36.420
Who are you?

16:36.420 --> 16:37.890
My name is Guzma.

16:37.890 --> 16:40.930
I'm from Kalb-Hu, as you can see.

16:40.930 --> 16:42.730
Kalb-Hu?

16:43.660 --> 16:46.930
You're not from around here, are you?

16:46.930 --> 16:50.700
This is another land that has now
been invaded by Zymot,

16:50.700 --> 16:53.700
but we were all once citizens of Kalb-Hu.

16:54.640 --> 16:56.740
We've been taken in as slaves

16:56.740 --> 16:59.800
and forced to train here to be
soldiers in their army.

17:00.650 --> 17:04.050
Resistance is death, as is losing a match.

17:04.050 --> 17:05.590
There's no way out of here,

17:05.590 --> 17:08.890
save winning your way into their
military, fight by fight.

17:08.890 --> 17:10.660
Then fight them!

17:10.660 --> 17:12.490
You saw what happened before!

17:12.490 --> 17:16.200
The women and children are kept hostage.

17:16.200 --> 17:18.800
We're all cornered.

17:18.800 --> 17:20.570
Those sons of bitches!

17:20.570 --> 17:23.040
That's the kind of country Zymot is.

17:29.680 --> 17:31.410
Princess Rebecca!

17:31.410 --> 17:32.510
What is it?

17:32.510 --> 17:34.580
We've received word:

17:34.580 --> 17:38.620
Zed has been captured and taken to
the underworld training ground.

17:38.620 --> 17:40.420
What did you say?!

17:42.090 --> 17:44.150
Princess Rebecca, where are you going?

17:45.460 --> 17:50.560
Phillip, am I nothing but a doll to all of you?

17:50.560 --> 17:53.190
I have my own will too!

17:55.240 --> 17:57.200
I shall accompany you.

18:00.140 --> 18:01.840
Here, Sagiri.

18:01.840 --> 18:03.640
Thank you!

18:05.810 --> 18:07.280
Ah, you look very pretty.

18:07.280 --> 18:08.280
You mean it?

18:08.280 --> 18:09.580
Sure do.

18:09.580 --> 18:12.790
You seem to be doing much better.

18:12.790 --> 18:15.360
Yes, sir, thanks to you.

18:15.360 --> 18:17.490
I don't know how to thank you.

18:17.490 --> 18:19.330
Think nothing of it.

18:19.330 --> 18:23.860
It's only natural to help those
who are hurt or taken ill.

18:23.860 --> 18:27.370
Hey, Noah, there are some more
pretty flowers over that way.

18:27.370 --> 18:28.640
Let's go!

18:28.640 --> 18:30.260
Sure!

18:40.050 --> 18:42.350
Get your asses out here now!

18:53.060 --> 18:54.690
Guzma!

18:55.660 --> 18:57.330
Go on, fight!

18:57.330 --> 19:01.740
Only those who fight and win
will leave here alive!

19:01.740 --> 19:04.530
I will get out of here alive!

19:09.310 --> 19:11.780
Damn, what should I do?!

19:19.050 --> 19:20.680
Damn!

19:24.190 --> 19:26.180
Is this my only choice?!

19:32.270 --> 19:36.570
I can't let myself die in a place like this either!

19:47.450 --> 19:48.780
Do it...

19:48.780 --> 19:50.580
Kill him!

19:53.890 --> 19:55.160
What are you waiting for?

19:55.160 --> 19:57.120
Kill him quickly!

19:58.560 --> 20:01.030
It's no use; I can't do it!

20:06.530 --> 20:08.500
What is that? What's going on?!

20:09.770 --> 20:11.710
Zed!

20:11.710 --> 20:12.840
Rebecca!

20:12.840 --> 20:15.140
What are you doing here?

20:15.140 --> 20:17.610
Who are you?

20:33.160 --> 20:36.200
Zed, let's get out of here quickly!

20:36.200 --> 20:39.230
But there's still a lot of people imprisoned here!

20:39.230 --> 20:40.430
They'll be okay.

20:40.430 --> 20:44.070
I'll leave the rest to Elda and Phillip.

20:44.070 --> 20:45.210
You know what to do.

20:45.210 --> 20:46.830
Yes, ma'am.

21:04.860 --> 21:06.660
I guess I owe you now.

21:06.660 --> 21:08.460
I suppose so.

21:09.360 --> 21:12.200
You said you wanted my help,

21:12.200 --> 21:15.040
but what you meant was Amir Gaul, right?

21:15.040 --> 21:16.660
Yes...

21:17.540 --> 21:20.110
Well, as far as Amir Gaul goes,

21:20.110 --> 21:23.880
I honestly don't really understand
how to control it myself.

21:23.880 --> 21:27.910
Zed, it's true that we do need Amir Gaul.

21:27.910 --> 21:31.010
But, Zed, it's you that fascinates me.

21:32.750 --> 21:35.490
I have heard that valuable spirits
like Amir Gaul

21:35.490 --> 21:38.060
choose a human on their own.

21:38.060 --> 21:41.030
These spirits cannot be claimed so easily.

21:42.060 --> 21:45.360
I was astonished when I first saw Amir Gaul.

21:46.800 --> 21:52.760
However, I was even more impressed
by your unfathomable power.

21:53.870 --> 21:57.830
With time, you will learn to control Amir Gaul.
You don't even have to rush it.

21:59.710 --> 22:05.020
So please, Zed, help me in
restoring my kingdom!

22:08.460 --> 22:11.250
I have come to get you, Princess Rebecca.

22:12.660 --> 22:14.660
Hugh!

22:14.660 --> 22:17.130
Come, let us go now.

22:21.940 --> 22:24.240
Hey, what's the matter?

22:24.240 --> 22:26.030
Who is that guy?

22:50.360 --> 22:54.230
Kimi no sono kokoro no naka o nozoite
shiritai sono kimochi to hyoujou

22:54.230 --> 22:58.140
Hitori seotta kimi no sugata kirari
hikaru namida no wake wa

22:58.140 --> 23:01.710
Kikazu ni iwazu ni okuru yo eeru
sagashiteru kotae no aida ni

23:01.710 --> 23:05.840
Kodawarisugizu kangaesugizu asu
no kimi ni komorebi kanjiru

23:07.550 --> 23:09.380
Very very much de ii kanji

23:09.380 --> 23:11.180
Very very good kimi to boku

23:11.180 --> 23:15.060
ltsudemo kimi no soba ni ite
agetai to omotterun da

23:15.060 --> 23:16.890
Very very much itsudatte

23:16.890 --> 23:18.730
Very very good kawaranai

23:18.730 --> 23:24.690
Bokura wa itsumo kibou de
chikarazuyoku saiterun da (Oh)

23:30.200 --> 23:32.670
Mayoi no naka kono yasashisa kanji

23:33.970 --> 23:36.440
Donna toki mo kimi o zutto shinji

23:37.710 --> 23:41.620
Koko ni ookiku hirogaru keshiki
buruusukai no hi no shita de

23:41.620 --> 23:45.750
li kibun ii mibun ii jibun zutto koko ni itai kibun

23:47.220 --> 23:49.020
Very very much de ii kanji

23:49.020 --> 23:50.860
Very very good kimi to boku

23:50.860 --> 23:54.660
ltsudemo kimi no soba ni ite
agetai toomotterun da

23:54.660 --> 23:56.530
Very very much itsudatte

23:56.530 --> 23:58.400
Very very good kawaranai

23:58.400 --> 24:04.360
Bokura wa itsumo kibou de
chikarazuyoku saiterun da (Oh)

24:17.020 --> 24:19.990
Next Time
A Looming Conspiracy

24:17.020 --> 24:19.990


Next time, "A Looming Conspiracy"
